      "side": 1,
      "message": "übernit: It looks like \"timing\" is only every used to prefix `msg`, so instead of having the before/after functions couldn\u0027t we just have the callers add it to the string they pass in?\n\ne.g. instead of\n```\nValidateBeforeIfNeeded(mod, capabilities, \"core.MyAwesomeTransform\");\n```\nyou could just write:\n```\nValidateIfNeeded(mod, capabilities, \"before core.MyAwesomeTransform\");\n\n```\nand then we don\u0027t need the different overloads?\n\nNot really a big deal and probably annoying to change all of this again now, so feel free to ignore.",
      "revId": "e1827ca28adf6aec7accd6119551caf9e829b5a3",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
