      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can see your point on wanting to simplify the params/reduce the number of overloads. I personally prefer the current form a little, since it avoids drift in the code, where people use slightly different forms for the logging messages, but that is a style preference.\n\nBut as you alluded to, I think the larger blocking issue to doing this is that it would require non-trivial effort.\n\n(Most of the ValidateBeforeIfNeeded(...) calls are formatted over multiple lines, so simple regex tools like sed fail to properly change things)",
      "parentUuid": "dcf51fbb_8872b310",
      "revId": "e1827ca28adf6aec7accd6119551caf9e829b5a3",
