      "side": 1,
      "message": "This means that if you enable dumping but do not have validation enabled, you will not get the dumps, which I think is a behavioral change from today.\nIt\u0027s kinda awkward that validation and dumping are intertwined like that, but also kinda useful to not have to call two different methods.\n\nCould we maybe split the dumping part out of Validate and then call it from both `Validate` and `ValidateIfNeeded`?",
